  "security_implications": "key_words[s] carries secret key shares. The mux can silently drive all-zero shares when KEY_WORDS_2345 is selected with AES192Enable false or when the selector falls into the default branch. This injects zero key material into the mix‑columns stage without error indication, potentially weakening the key schedule, enabling fault attacks, or exposing differential leakage.",
